## Launch Campaign

Starts a Campaign: its status moves from `planned` to `running`. Only a planned campaign can be launched; one that is completed or canceled is refused with its current status in the message. A campaign with no start date starts on the day it is launched. A running campaign is left as it is, so running the command again changes nothing.

```ts
import LaunchCampaignCommand from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/crm/commands/launch-campaign-command';

let { campaign, message } = await new LaunchCampaignCommand(
  commandContext,
).execute({ campaign });
```

### Example

Logistics Expo 2026, a planned event campaign.

### Non-goals

Building or sending the campaign's content, scheduling, and budget control.
